<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="container app-main narrow prose">
  <h1>About <%= app.appName %></h1>
  <p><%= app.appName %> is a free, open-source app that helps individuals and church communities read through the entire Bible in one year with a structured 52-week plan, built for the glory of God.</p>
  <p>Each week you read across four tracks — Psalms &amp; Wisdom, Law &amp; History, the Prophets, and the Gospels &amp; Letters — so your reading stays varied and balanced through the year.</p>
  <h2>Credits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Scripture content from the <a href="https://bible.helloao.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HelloAO Free Use Bible API</a> — no API keys, no limits.</li>
    <li>The Berean Standard Bible (BSB), dedicated to the public domain.</li>
    <li>Cross-references from <a href="https://www.openbible.info/labs/cross-references/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenBible.info</a>, licensed <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>.</li>
    <li>This is a modern Node.js rebuild of the original PHP project.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="muted"><em>Soli Deo Gloria</em> — To God alone be the glory.</p>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
